{"title":"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/b/21bea01637b90041b10801913cdb08b4e4ec7a36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1=d_1&lt;d_2&lt;\\cdots&lt;d_k=n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"213\" height=\"15\" /> be the divisors of a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the sum of all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054ee241ffbf72252a3df17d35fb103104662401.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n=d_1^1+d_2^2+d_3^3+d_4^4.\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"19\" /> Find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even, as if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd then the RHS is even and the LHS is odd. This implies that the first two divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Now, there are three cases (note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245a5501248a6ea24f520f76d4140cedf08e1674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> represents a prime): \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e34832a47f230be9bcc349b7b912dfdf462ca177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ d_3, d_4 \\} = \\{ p_1, p_2 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a90921c059dd4d23964c679ac04a0874bcc5cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2^2+p_1^3+p_2^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"19\" /> is always odd, so this is a contradiction. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e349515d54121a46599adc336c33ce13ac3241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ d_3, d_4 \\} = \\{ p_1, 2p_1 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />. This implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5dbc41711b35e6c71ca46ab32a0426b11e9aa3e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 | 1+2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/6/2c603c2deae5d06461d6bf197c044786f2a905bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c75b7a60fda228d09c6ad0b3496734e8c42ae602.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1+2^2+5^3+10^4 = 10130$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"238\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d37bdda35985ed0247fdb8dcde80738abe7cf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ d_3, d_4 \\} = \\{ 4, p_1 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78f9e4139923d5ff4033a73f47bdca0c412af129.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 &lt; 4 \\implies p_1 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/222eaeda167732ca4771fd04fca39be233af0882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 288$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/7413def4ff249b9f1d0d671ddfa657179c065213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 \\geq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8be9d3c56ec6e85b1ddba2ab883de364215e067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4p_1 | 1+2^3+4^3+p_1^4 \\implies p_1 | 1+2^2+4^3 = 69$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"355\" height=\"19\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4ffdbd3141cf81b577b80b2d6d290551f1790d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 = 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/7413def4ff249b9f1d0d671ddfa657179c065213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 \\geq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />, however, this fails. \n</p><p><br />\nSo, the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffef1d65086ff08d62d6a4107e179cf1c0a24669.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10130 + 288 = 10418$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"163\" height=\"14\" />, so the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6ce6f6c0a023c8d3b667ee34b9e6bb962c87106a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{418}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />. ~rocketsri\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I\" title=\"2020 CIME I\">2020 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 CIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CIME Problems and Solutions\"> All CIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003725\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 230/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1477/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 110/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5794/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.583      1 -total\n 81.14%   11.832      1 Template:CIME_box\n 17.40%    2.537      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser c